<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0">
<title>메이트 기본 응대 원칙</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --navy:#1E2761;
    --navy-deep:#141A47;
    --paper:#FFFFFF;
    --line:#E7E9F2;
    --muted:#8A8FA8;
    --ink:#1B1D29;
    --ready-bg:#F4F5FA;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  html,body{margin:0;padding:0;}
  body{
    background:var(--paper);
    font-family:"Noto Sans KR","맑은 고딕",sans-serif;
    color:var(--ink);
    min-height:100vh;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    align-items:center;
  }

  .top{
    width:100%;
    max-width:460px;
    padding:40px 24px 20px;
    text-align:center;
  }
  .back{
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:4px;
    font-size:13px;
    font-weight:600;
    color:var(--muted);
    text-decoration:none;
    margin-bottom:18px;
  }
  .eyebrow{
    font-size:12px;
    font-weight:700;
    letter-spacing:.14em;
    color:var(--navy);
    text-transform:uppercase;
    margin-bottom:14px;
    opacity:.7;
  }
  h1{
    font-size:24px;
    font-weight:800;
    margin:0 0 10px;
    color:var(--navy-deep);
    letter-spacing:-0.01em;
  }
  .sub{
    font-size:14px;
    color:var(--muted);
    line-height:1.6;
    margin:0;
  }

  main{
    width:100%;
    max-width:460px;
    padding:8px 20px 60px;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    gap:12px;
  }

  details.card{
    border-radius:16px;
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    background:var(--paper);
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  details.card[open]{
    border-color:var(--navy);
    box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(30,39,97,0.10);
  }

  summary{
    list-style:none;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:16px;
    padding:18px 18px;
    cursor:pointer;
  }
  summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none;}

  .num{
    flex:0 0 auto;
    width:40px;
    height:40px;
    border-radius:12px;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    font-size:15px;
    font-weight:800;
    background:var(--navy);
    color:#fff;
  }
  .text{
    flex:1 1 auto;
    min-width:0;
  }
  .card-title{
    font-size:15px;
    font-weight:700;
    margin:0;
    color:var(--navy-deep);
  }
  .card-desc{
    font-size:12px;
    color:var(--muted);
    margin:2px 0 0;
  }
  .chev{
    flex:0 0 auto;
    color:var(--navy);
    font-size:14px;
    opacity:.55;
    transition:transform .15s ease;
  }
  details[open] .chev{
    transform:rotate(90deg);
  }

  .video-wrap{
    padding:0 18px 18px;
  }
  video{
    width:100%;
    border-radius:12px;
    background:#000;
    display:block;
  }

  footer{
    padding:10px 24px 40px;
    text-align:center;
  }
  footer p{
    font-size:11.5px;
    color:var(--muted);
    margin:0;
  }

  @media (max-width:360px){
    h1{font-size:21px;}
    .num{width:36px;height:36px;font-size:13px;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="top">
    <a class="back" href="../">‹ SOP 허브로</a>
    <div class="eyebrow">메이트 교육</div>
    <h1>메이트 기본 응대 원칙</h1>
    <p class="sub">1분짜리 영상 6편으로 알아보는<br>기본 응대 원칙입니다.</p>
  </div>

  <main>

    <details class="card" name="video-acc">
      <summary>
        <div class="num">1</div>
        <div class="text">
          <p class="card-title">CX란?</p>
          <p class="card-desc">1편 · 1분</p>
        </div>
        <span class="chev">›</span>
      </summary>
      <div class="video-wrap">
        <video controls preload="none" playsinline>
          <source src="videos/1.mp4" type="video/mp4">
          영상을 재생할 수 없는 브라우저입니다.
        </video>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="card" name="video-acc">
      <summary>
        <div class="num">2</div>
        <div class="text">
          <p class="card-title">음식에서 이물질이 나왔을 때</p>
          <p class="card-desc">2편 · 1분</p>
        </div>
        <span class="chev">›</span>
      </summary>
      <div class="video-wrap">
        <video controls preload="none" playsinline>
          <source src="videos/2.mp4" type="video/mp4">
          영상을 재생할 수 없는 브라우저입니다.
        </video>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="card" name="video-acc">
      <summary>
        <div class="num">3</div>
        <div class="text">
          <p class="card-title">서비스 클레임이 발생했을 때</p>
          <p class="card-desc">3편 · 1분</p>
        </div>
        <span class="chev">›</span>
      </summary>
      <div class="video-wrap">
        <video controls preload="none" playsinline>
          <source src="videos/3.mp4" type="video/mp4">
          영상을 재생할 수 없는 브라우저입니다.
        </video>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="card" name="video-acc">
      <summary>
        <div class="num">4</div>
        <div class="text">
          <p class="card-title">캐셔에서 발생할 수 있는 일</p>
          <p class="card-desc">4편 · 1분</p>
        </div>
        <span class="chev">›</span>
      </summary>
      <div class="video-wrap">
        <video controls preload="none" playsinline>
          <source src="videos/4.mp4" type="video/mp4">
          영상을 재생할 수 없는 브라우저입니다.
        </video>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="card" name="video-acc">
      <summary>
        <div class="num">5</div>
        <div class="text">
          <p class="card-title">이용시간 안내 방법</p>
          <p class="card-desc">5편 · 1분</p>
        </div>
        <span class="chev">›</span>
      </summary>
      <div class="video-wrap">
        <video controls preload="none" playsinline>
          <source src="videos/5.mp4" type="video/mp4">
          영상을 재생할 수 없는 브라우저입니다.
        </video>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="card" name="video-acc">
      <summary>
        <div class="num">6</div>
        <div class="text">
          <p class="card-title">총정리</p>
          <p class="card-desc">6편 · 1분</p>
        </div>
        <span class="chev">›</span>
      </summary>
      <div class="video-wrap">
        <video controls preload="none" playsinline>
          <source src="videos/6.mp4" type="video/mp4">
          영상을 재생할 수 없는 브라우저입니다.
        </video>
      </div>
    </details>

  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>이랜드이츠 CX팀</p>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
